"Add a pilot by their Infinite Flight display name, spelled the way it appears on the map." = "按地图上显示的 Infinite Flight 名称添加飞行员。";
"Aircraft kinds come from the same table that picks each plane's icon, so anything the map can draw, this can narrow down to." = "飞机类别与选择每架飞机图标的表相同，所以地图能画的都能在这里筛选。";
"Aircraft that filed here but have not left their gate sort to the bottom of Inbound, marked Parked." = "申报飞往此处但尚未离开登机口的飞机排在进港列表底部，标记为“停放”。";
"Airports shows where the server actually is: the busiest fields right now, ranked by what pilots have filed." = "“机场”显示服务器上的真实热点：根据飞行员申报，列出当前最繁忙的机场。";
"An aerial beside an airport code means somebody is working that field right now." = "机场代码旁的天线表示此刻有人在管制该机场。";
"Any field in the busiest lists opens straight from here." = "繁忙列表中的任何机场都可以直接从这里打开。";
"Centre positions work an airspace rather than an airport, so they are listed apart — there is no field to open behind one." = "区调席位管制的是空域而非机场，所以单独列出——没有可打开的机场。";
"Drag this window down to its peek and the map stays live behind it — you can pan and zoom without closing the flight." = "把窗口下拉到预览，后面的地图仍可操作——无需关闭航班即可平移和缩放。";
"Every aircraft listed here opens its own window." = "这里列出的每架飞机都会打开自己的窗口。";
"Every link under DELIVERY has to be green. Each one of them fails quietly on its own, which is why they are listed rather than assumed." = "“推送”下的每一项都必须是绿色。每项都可能悄悄失败，所以逐项列出而不是默认没问题。";
"Every number here is counted from the same packet the map is drawn from, so it can never disagree with what you are looking at — and none of it is fetched." = "这里的每个数字都来自绘制地图的同一数据包，所以绝不会与你看到的不一致——也不需要额外获取。";
"Field conditions cost nothing. The reports are already on the device for the colours the airport codes are drawn in — this only decides whether the wind and temperature are written under them." = "机场天气不需要额外成本。报文已在设备上用于给机场代码着色——这里只决定是否在下方写出风和温度。";
"Filed route lists every fix on the plan, with the one being flown to picked out — and the same route is drawn on the map underneath." = "申报航路列出计划中的每个航路点，并突出显示当前飞往的点——同一航路也画在下方地图上。";
"Filters only ever take traffic away, and never touch what is received — so turning them all back on is instant. What is drawn over the traffic is in Settings › Layers." = "筛选只会隐藏交通，从不改动接收的数据——全部重新打开也是瞬间完成。交通上方绘制的内容在“设置 › 图层”。";
"Inbound is ordered by how long each aircraft has to run at its current ground speed — not by how far out it is." = "进港按每架飞机以当前地速剩余的时间排序——而不是按距离。";
"Open a flight and the map draws the plan it filed — the line, and every fix on it named. Settings › Layers has the switch if you would rather it didn't." = "打开航班后，地图会绘制其申报的计划——航路线和每个命名的航路点。不需要的话可在“设置 › 图层”中关闭。";
"Pin puts this flight on the home-screen widget, drawn on the aircraft's own photo." = "固定后，此航班会以飞机照片显示在主屏幕小组件上。";
"Pitch and bank on the PFD are read from the simulator when the pilot is broadcasting through Connect, and worked out from the flight path and the rate of turn when they are not. The display says which, every time." = "飞行员通过 Connect 广播时，PFD 的俯仰和坡度读取自模拟器；否则根据航迹和转弯率推算。显示屏始终会注明来源。";
"Pull the tab on top of the toolbar for what the server is doing right now — how many are up, how many are on the ground, who is working. All of it counted from the packet the map is drawn from." = "拉起工具栏上方的标签，查看服务器此刻的状况——多少在飞、多少在地面、谁在管制。全部来自绘制地图的数据包。";
"Radar and cloud are drawn as tiles under the traffic, and the strip over the map scrubs back through the last two hours of frames." = "雷达和云图以图块形式画在交通下方，地图上方的条可回看过去两小时的画面。";
"Replay flies the track this aircraft has already covered, at whatever speed you set." = "回放会按你设定的速度重现此飞机已飞过的航迹。";
"Reports are held for as long as they stay current, so panning around a busy area never re-fetches the same field." = "报文在有效期内会保留，所以在繁忙区域平移时不会重复获取同一机场。";
"Search finds callsigns, pilot names, registrations and ICAO codes — all of it from what is already on the device, so it answers as you type." = "搜索可查找呼号、飞行员名称、注册号和 ICAO 代码——全部基于设备上已有的数据，所以边输入边出结果。";
"Settings › Layers can draw the North Atlantic tracks, coloured by letter with the levels each is valid at — which is what explains a hundred aircraft flying in parallel across the ocean." = "“设置 › 图层”可以绘制北大西洋航迹，按字母着色并标注各自有效的高度层——这就是上百架飞机在海上平行飞行的原因。";
"Tap any field to open it: the same controllers, plus its weather and everything inbound." = "轻点任意机场即可打开：同样的管制员，外加天气和所有进港飞机。";
"Tap either end of the route to open that airport — its weather, who is on frequency, and everything else heading there. The way back is the first row." = "轻点航路任一端可打开该机场——天气、在线管制员以及所有飞往那里的飞机。返回是第一行。";
"The aerial badge means someone is on frequency there." = "天线徽标表示那里有人在线管制。";
"The altitude colours here are the same ones the map paints a flown path in, so the filter and the track agree on what \"low\" means." = "这里的高度颜色与地图绘制已飞航迹所用的相同，所以筛选和航迹对“低”的定义一致。";
"The arrow button beside the window puts the map on this aircraft and keeps it there as it flies. The viewfinder above it frames the whole flight instead — both ends of the route and everything flown so far." = "窗口旁的箭头按钮会将地图对准此飞机并持续跟随。上方的取景按钮则框住整个航班——航路两端和目前已飞的全部航迹。";
"The board counts flight plans, not aeroplanes on the ground. A field can be busy here before anyone has pushed back." = "该榜单统计的是飞行计划，而不是地面上的飞机。在有人推出之前，机场就可能显示为繁忙。";
"The cruise figure is a median rather than an average: one aircraft at fifty thousand feet drags a mean and says nothing about where the server actually is." = "巡航数值采用中位数而非平均值：一架五万英尺的飞机就会拉高平均值，却说明不了服务器的实际情况。";
"The curved-line button beside the window draws the track this aircraft has actually flown, back to departure rather than to when you opened the app — and puts the map on it." = "窗口旁的曲线按钮会绘制此飞机实际飞过的航迹——从起飞开始，而非从你打开应用开始——并将地图对准它。";
"The instruments card carries a primary flight display and a navigation display. Tap the arrows on it for the full screen, and the switch beside them to change which one you are looking at." = "仪表卡片包含主飞行显示器和导航显示器。轻点箭头进入全屏，旁边的开关用于切换显示。";
"The map-style button asks two things now: what shape the world is — flat or the globe — and what it is drawn in, light, dark, near black or satellite. Any pairing works, so the globe can be black and the flat map can be imagery." = "地图样式按钮现在问两件事：世界的形状——平面还是地球——以及绘制方式：浅色、深色、近黑或卫星。任意组合都可以，地球可以是黑色，平面地图也可以是卫星图。";
"The notices about your own flight are worked out from the feed by the server, so they arrive with Inflight closed and the simulator in front of you." = "关于你自己航班的通知由服务器根据数据判断，所以即使关闭 Inflight、正在玩模拟器也能收到。";
"The ruler under the map-style button measures a leg: tap two places and it gives you the great-circle distance, the heading to fly it on, and roughly how long it takes. Taps near a field name the field." = "地图样式按钮下方的标尺可以测量一段航程：轻点两处，即可得到大圆距离、飞行航向和大致用时。点在机场附近会显示机场名称。";
"The weather chip, bottom left, has radar and cloud tiles for the map and wind barbs at any flight level from 050 to 390. The strip that appears says which frame you are looking at, and can be dragged back through the last two hours." = "左下角的天气标签提供地图的雷达和云图，以及 050 至 390 任意高度层的风羽。出现的条显示当前画面，可向后拖动回看两小时。";
"There is no cap on how many aircraft the map draws. Zoom out as far as you like — if the server has two thousand aeroplanes in view, you get two thousand." = "地图绘制的飞机数量没有上限。随意缩小——服务器视野内有两千架飞机，你就会看到两千架。";
"Units are a display choice. Reports arrive the same either way, so switching costs nothing and is instant." = "单位只是显示选项。报文到达的方式都一样，所以切换没有任何成本，且立即生效。";
"Watch a pilot and you will get a notification when they take off and when they land, even with the app closed." = "关注飞行员后，即使关闭应用，也会在其起飞和着陆时收到通知。";
"Wind barbs read the way a chart's do: a filled pennant is fifty knots, a full feather ten, a half feather five — and the staff points into the wind." = "风羽的读法与天气图相同：实心三角旗为五十节，整羽为十节，半羽为五节——杆指向风的来向。";
"Your face, top right, is one tap to your profile as other pilots see it — and it stays there while you are watching an aeroplane. Hold it for your account and for Pro." = "右上角的头像一点即可查看其他飞行员看到的你的个人资料，查看飞机时它也一直在那里。长按可进入账户和 Pro。";
