"Composite precipitation radar, two hours of it. The free tier serves tiles only down to a low zoom, so it softens as you close in rather than sharpening — but it stays on the map all the way in, the same way the web tracker's does." = "两小时的合成降水雷达。免费级别只提供低缩放级别的图块，所以放大时会变柔和而不是更清晰——但和网页版一样，始终显示在地图上。";
"How far the air at the chosen level is from the standard atmosphere. Warm is thin: the same aircraft climbs worse and burns more in it." = "所选高度层的空气偏离标准大气的程度。温度高意味着空气稀薄：同一架飞机爬升更差、油耗更高。";
"How much the wind changes between this level and the one below, per thousand feet. Not a turbulence forecast — it is the field turbulence forecasts are built from, and the bumps are where it is strong." = "此高度层与下方高度层之间每千英尺的风变化。这不是颠簸预报——而是构建预报的基础数据，颠簸就出现在其较强的地方。";
"NASA's global satellite imagery, a day at a time. Reads at cruise and out over the ocean, where there is no radar to see with — but it is yesterday's picture rather than this minute's, and the strip can be dragged back through the last few days. Softens as you close in: it is a photograph of the ground, and a magnified photograph is a blurred photograph." = "NASA 全球卫星图像，按天更新。在巡航和海上没有雷达的地方很有用——但它是昨天的画面而不是此刻，条可回拖查看前几天。放大时会变模糊：它是地面照片，放大的照片自然模糊。";
