"Airborne aircraft keep flying between the server's updates, at the heading and speed they last reported, instead of jumping each time one lands. Off, every aeroplane sits exactly where it was last reported. Aircraft on the ground never move on their own either way." = "空中的飞机在服务器更新之间会按最后报告的航向和速度继续飞行，而不是每次更新时跳动。关闭后，每架飞机都停留在最后报告的位置。地面上的飞机在任何情况下都不会自行移动。";
