"An open community ADS-B network. The data is published under the Open Database Licence by the people who run the receivers, and Inflight has no affiliation with them." = "一个开放的社区 ADS-B 网络。数据由接收机运营者以开放数据库许可证发布，Inflight 与他们没有关联。";
"Attitude, speed, height and heading. Pitch and bank are read from the simulator when the pilot is broadcasting through Connect, and worked out from the flight path and the rate of turn when they are not — the display says which." = "姿态、速度、高度和航向。通过 Connect 广播时俯仰和坡度读取自模拟器，否则根据航迹和转弯率推算——显示屏会注明来源。";
"BEHIND THE PLANET" = "星球背后";
"Brightness" = "亮度";
"CONTROLLED AIRSPACE" = "管制空域";
"CREDITS" = "致谢";
"Callsigns" = "呼号";
"Colours" = "颜色";
"Connecting…" = "正在连接…";
"Coverage is wherever volunteers have receivers — excellent over Europe and North America, patchy over oceans, deserts and much of the southern hemisphere. Military and other traffic that does not broadcast is simply absent." = "覆盖范围取决于志愿者的接收机——欧洲和北美极佳，海洋、沙漠和南半球大部分地区则零散。军机及不发射信号的飞机完全不会出现。";
"Day and night" = "昼夜";
"Draws real aircraft alongside the server's, from ADS-B — the position reports real aeroplanes broadcast and a network of volunteer receivers picks up. They are painted mint, so you can always tell them from the simulator's traffic at a glance." = "根据 ADS-B——真实飞机发出、由志愿者接收机网络收集的位置报告——在服务器飞机旁绘制真实飞机。它们用薄荷绿显示，一眼就能和模拟器交通区分开。";
"Draws runways, taxiways and terminals with their names once the map is over a field. From OpenStreetMap, so it is as good as the field's mapping." = "当地图位于机场上空时，绘制带名称的跑道、滑行道和航站楼。数据来自 OpenStreetMap，精度取决于该机场的测绘。";
"Draws the nearest aircraft from the feed, with how far above or below they are in hundreds of feet. Anything within two thousand feet is picked out." = "显示数据中最近的飞机，并以百英尺为单位标出高度差。两千英尺以内的飞机会被突出显示。";
"Draws the track an open flight has actually flown, coloured by the height it was at. Fetched from the server so it reaches back to departure, not just to when you opened the app." = "绘制已打开航班实际飞过的航迹，按高度着色。从服务器获取，所以可追溯到起飞，而不只是打开应用之后。";
"Draws the traffic as aircraft, pointing where they are going, rather than as dots. A packet too dense for silhouettes to read falls back to dots on its own." = "以指向前进方向的飞机形状而非圆点显示交通。过于密集无法辨认时会自动改回圆点。";
