"Looked up by the Mode S address it broadcasts, from Planespotters — so it is that airframe rather than a stock shot of the type. The photographer is credited on the picture and tapping either opens the original on Planespotters.net. Free for everyone, never part of Pro." = "根据其广播的 Mode S 地址在 Planespotters 上查找——所以是那架飞机本身，而不是该机型的通用图片。图片上注明摄影师，轻点即可在 Planespotters.net 上打开原图。对所有人免费，从不属于 Pro。";
"Looking for Infinite Flight on this network…" = "正在此网络中查找 Infinite Flight…";
"MATERIAL" = "材质";
