"Marks fields with somebody on frequency, and the busiest of the rest. Tap one to open it." = "标记有人在线管制的机场，以及其余最繁忙的机场。轻点即可打开。";
"Mint aeroplanes" = "薄荷绿飞机";
"Missing" = "缺失";
