"Names each fix on the plan. Turn it off to keep the diamonds and lose the labels — a long-haul plan is forty of them, and at a zoom that fits the whole route the names cover the route. On the flat map and the planet alike." = "为计划中的每个航路点标注名称。关闭后保留菱形标记、去掉标签——远程计划有四十个航路点，在显示全程的缩放下，名称会盖住航路。平面地图和星球都适用。";
"Normal" = "正常";
"North Atlantic tracks" = "北大西洋航迹";
