"Only what somebody heard" = "只有被接收到的";
"Opens on" = "默认打开";
"Outlines the airspace of every centre with somebody working it, and names the station on it. Only staffed sectors — the whole boundary network would be a second map over the first. Off until you ask for it." = "勾勒每个有人值守的区调空域并标注席位名称。只显示有人管制的扇区——整个边界网络会像在地图上再叠一张地图。默认关闭，需手动开启。";
"PARTNER VIRTUAL AIRLINES" = "合作虚拟航空公司";
"PILOTS" = "飞行员";
"PLANET COLOUR" = "星球颜色";
"Paints our moderators' aircraft light blue. Their flight windows carry a MOD badge either way." = "将我们版主的飞机涂成浅蓝色。无论如何，他们的航班窗口都带有 MOD 徽标。";
"Paints the aircraft of pilots who are Infinite Flight controllers — any ATC rank above Observer — dark green. Each pilot is looked up once and remembered for a few days, so the colours fill in over the first minutes. Their flight windows carry an IFATC badge either way." = "将身为 Infinite Flight 管制员（Observer 以上任何管制等级）的飞行员飞机涂成深绿色。每位飞行员只查询一次并记住数天，所以颜色会在最初几分钟内陆续出现。无论如何，他们的航班窗口都带有 IFATC 徽标。";
"Privacy Policy" = "隐私政策";
"Puts a partner VA's own logo over the aeroplanes flying its callsign, so you can pick its traffic out of a busy server at a glance. Only where the callsign says so — never on a guess — and only once the map is zoomed in far enough to read them. Flat map only for now; the planet draws no marks on its traffic." = "在使用合作虚拟航空公司呼号的飞机上叠加其标志，让你在繁忙的服务器上一眼认出它的航班。只有呼号表明时才显示——从不猜测——并且只在放大到足以看清时显示。目前仅支持平面地图；星球上不绘制标志。";
"Puts a primary flight display and a navigation display in every flight window — attitude, speed and height on one, the filed route and the traffic around it on the other." = "在每个航班窗口中加入主飞行显示器和导航显示器——一个显示姿态、速度和高度，另一个显示申报航路和周边交通。";
"Read your landing rate and your own aircraft straight from the sim." = "直接从模拟器读取你的着陆率和自己的飞机数据。";
"Reading what this aircraft publishes…" = "正在读取此飞机发布的数据…";
"Real traffic is drawn in a colour nothing else on the map uses. Ordinary traffic stays white, the aircraft you have open stays amber, your own stays whatever you painted it." = "真实交通用地图上其他元素都不使用的颜色绘制。普通交通仍为白色，你打开的飞机仍为琥珀色，你自己的飞机保持你设定的颜色。";
"Roads, terrain shading and place names at full strength, rather than the muted cartography the map recedes into behind the traffic. Imagery has none of it to turn up." = "以全强度显示道路、地形晕渲和地名，而不是退到交通背后的淡化地图。卫星图像没有这些可以增强。";
