"Find it in Infinite Flight under Settings → General → Infinite Flight Connect. Or search the network for it." = "在 Infinite Flight 的“设置 → 通用 → Infinite Flight Connect”中可以找到。也可以在网络中搜索。";
"From aiming point" = "距瞄准点";
"Infinite Flight announces itself on the network while Connect is on. If nothing is found, enter the device's address below." = "Connect 开启时，Infinite Flight 会在网络上广播自己。如果找不到，请在下方输入设备地址。";
"Infinite Flight answers only while it is running, and this app runs only while it is not behind it — so the link is made in the moments either side of a switch. Inflight keeps trying for about half a minute after you leave it, and again the instant you come back." = "Infinite Flight 只在运行时响应，而本应用只在未被它遮挡时运行——所以连接发生在切换应用的前后片刻。离开后 Inflight 会继续尝试约半分钟，回来时立即再次尝试。";
"Infinite Flight publishes the controller's name over Connect but not the messages themselves, so this is as far as it goes. Everything else still works." = "Infinite Flight 通过 Connect 发布管制员姓名，但不发布通话内容，所以只能到此为止。其他功能照常。";
"It's checked automatically each time you open Inflight. The button above is for when you want to be sure." = "每次打开 Inflight 都会自动检查。上面的按钮用于你想确认的时候。";
"It's on this device" = "在此设备上";
"LAST LANDING" = "上次着陆";
"Last sent" = "上次发送";
"Last tried %@ · %@" = "上次尝试 %@ · %@";
"Live from %@" = "实时来自 %@";
"Looking for Infinite Flight…" = "正在查找 Infinite Flight…";
"Measured by Infinite Flight, not worked out from the map. It goes on the flight in your logbook." = "由 Infinite Flight 测量，而非根据地图推算。会记录到你飞行日志中的该航班。";
"NOT PUBLISHED BY THIS AIRCRAFT" = "此飞机未发布的数据";
"No attempt yet" = "尚未尝试";
"No banners. The panel still says what happened — you just have to come and look." = "不显示横幅。面板仍会说明发生了什么——你只需过来看看。";
"Not reading the sim" = "未读取模拟器";
"Not running — turn on Read from the sim" = "未运行——请打开“从模拟器读取”";
"Nothing about this flight is being sent anywhere, so your flight window has nothing to show. That is what the switch above does." = "此航班没有向任何地方发送内容，所以你的航班窗口没有可显示的。这就是上方开关的作用。";
"Nothing on frequency. Infinite Flight publishes the controller's name over Connect but not what is said, so there is no transcript to show — everything else still works." = "频率上没有人。Infinite Flight 通过 Connect 发布管制员姓名但不发布通话内容，所以没有可显示的记录——其他功能照常。";
"Notifications are off, so there is no way to tell you whether this connected — it happens while you are in Infinite Flight. Turning them back on lives in iOS Settings." = "通知已关闭，无法告诉你是否连接成功——连接发生在你使用 Infinite Flight 期间。可在 iOS 设置中重新开启。";
"ON ONE DEVICE" = "单台设备";
"Off centreline" = "偏离中线";
"On frequency" = "所在频率";
"On one device the live parts need both apps on screen at once, which is an iPad thing. Landings are picked up whatever you fly on." = "在单台设备上，实时功能需要两个应用同时显示在屏幕上，这只有 iPad 能做到。无论在哪台设备上飞，着陆都会被记录。";
"Open Inflight beside Infinite Flight in Split View and everything works live — the whole flight, as it happens." = "在分屏中把 Inflight 与 Infinite Flight 并排打开，一切实时运行——整个飞行过程即时呈现。";
