"Read from the sim" = "从模拟器读取";
"Reading from the sim is off, so nothing is running. Turning this on turns it back on — the switch above is the feature, this one only says where the simulator is." = "“从模拟器读取”已关闭，所以什么都没有运行。打开此项会重新开启它——上方开关是功能本身，这个只说明模拟器在哪里。";
