"Reads your aircraft straight from Infinite Flight on this device. Needs Connect switched on in the sim, under Settings → General." = "直接从此设备上的 Infinite Flight 读取你的飞机。需要在模拟器的“设置 → 通用”中开启 Connect。";
"Reads your aircraft straight from Infinite Flight over Wi-Fi. Needs the sim running on another device on this network, with Connect switched on in its settings." = "通过 Wi-Fi 直接从 Infinite Flight 读取你的飞机。需要模拟器在同一网络的另一台设备上运行，并在其设置中开启 Connect。";
