"Share what the sim reports" = "分享模拟器报告的内容";
"Sign in and claim a handle. A live status belongs to a profile, and there is nowhere to put one without it." = "请登录并认领用户名。实时状态属于个人资料，没有个人资料就无处放置。";
"Squawk" = "应答机";
"Stalling" = "失速";
"Talks to Infinite Flight over this device's own loopback. No Wi-Fi, no address, and no local network permission." = "通过本设备自身的回环地址与 Infinite Flight 通信。无需 Wi-Fi、地址或本地网络权限。";
"Tell me when it connects" = "连接时通知我";
"The flight your logbook records is confirmed by the sim rather than matched by name." = "飞行日志记录的航班由模拟器确认，而不是按名称匹配。";
"The last few things said on your frequency. Kept while you fly and thrown away afterwards — nothing here is recorded." = "你所在频率上最近的几条通话。飞行期间保留，之后丢弃——这里不做任何记录。";
"The order that works: open Infinite Flight, let it finish loading, then switch back here. Coming back is usually the attempt that succeeds, because the sim is still awake behind you — and the notification arrives then." = "有效的顺序：打开 Infinite Flight，等它加载完成，然后切回这里。切回来的那次尝试通常会成功，因为模拟器仍在后台运行——通知也在那时到达。";
"This aircraft isn't publishing a position over Connect, so there is nothing to send. See NOT PUBLISHED BY THIS AIRCRAFT below — that list is what to send me." = "此飞机没有通过 Connect 发布位置，所以没有可发送的内容。请看下方“此飞机未发布的数据”——把那份列表发给我。";
"Touchdown speed" = "接地速度";
"Tuned to %@." = "已调谐到 %@。";
"Turn on if you fly on this same iPhone or iPad rather than a second device." = "如果你在这台 iPhone 或 iPad 上飞行而不是另一台设备，请打开。";
"Use %@" = "使用 %@";
