"Waiting" = "等待中";
"Waiting for Infinite Flight" = "正在等待 Infinite Flight";
"While you fly, iOS suspends Inflight behind the simulator, so it cannot watch the flight itself." = "飞行期间，iOS 会在模拟器后台暂停 Inflight，所以它无法自己跟踪飞行。";
"Who can see it is set on your profile, under Live status. It defaults to people who follow you — where you are now is a different thing from where you have been." = "谁能看到在你的个人资料“实时状态”中设置。默认是关注你的人——你现在在哪里与你去过哪里是两回事。";
"Works only while Infinite Flight is running on another device on this Wi-Fi. Flights flown anywhere else are still recorded, just without the landing." = "仅在 Infinite Flight 于同一 Wi-Fi 下的另一台设备上运行时有效。在其他地方飞的航班仍会记录，只是没有着陆数据。";
"Your flight is recorded from the map either way. Come back here after landing and the touchdown is read from the simulator and added to it — Infinite Flight keeps the last landing until the next one, so nothing has to be watching at the time." = "无论如何，你的航班都会通过地图记录。着陆后回到这里，接地数据会从模拟器读取并添加——Infinite Flight 会保留上次着陆直到下一次，所以当时不需要有任何东西在看着。";
"Your landing rate, g-force and how straight you put it down — numbers the map can never measure, because a touchdown is over before the next position arrives." = "你的着陆率、G 值以及着陆有多正——地图永远无法测量，因为接地在下一个位置到达前就结束了。";
"Your position, phase of flight and configuration go on your profile while you fly. Turning this off deletes it." = "飞行时，你的位置、飞行阶段和构型会显示在个人资料上。关闭即删除。";
