"A grid of model wind across whatever the map is showing, drawn as chart barbs — a pennant is fifty knots, a full feather ten, a half five." = "在地图显示范围内以风羽符号绘制模型风场网格——三角旗代表五十节，长羽十节，短羽五节。";
"Adds the ten-day outlook and the sun, twilight and moon times to an airport's panel, under the forecast. The outlook came down with the forecast and the sky is arithmetic, so this only decides how far the panel scrolls." = "在机场面板的预报下方添加十天展望以及日出、晨昏和月亮时间。展望随预报一起下载，天象只是计算，所以这项只决定面板能滚动多远。";
"Animate" = "动画";
"Draws the air as streaks running the way it is going, with the fast ones longer. The clock is scaled so the movement reads at whatever the map is showing — the speeds are true against each other, not against a watch." = "将空气绘制为沿其流向移动的线条，越快越长。时间经过缩放，使运动在任何地图比例下都清晰可读——速度彼此间的比例是真实的，但与真实时钟无关。";
