"Opening the chip adds the departure and arrival fields to the one being passed." = "打开小标签会在当前经过的机场之外加入出发和到达机场。";
"Reports are issued in knots; the others are converted for reading." = "报文以节为单位发布；其他单位是为方便阅读而换算的。";
"Reports come from VATSIM's METAR service, the same source the tracker has always used, and each station issues one an hour. Where a field files none — which is most of the world's airfields — the reading is Open-Meteo's model, and says so; the same request carries the forecast and the outlook, and the sun and moon times are worked out on the device. Severe-weather warnings come from the National Weather Service, which covers the United States and nowhere else. The radar tiles are RainViewer's; the satellite imagery is from NASA's Global Imagery Browse Services, part of their Earth Science Data and Information System; the winds aloft are Open-Meteo's too. None of it costs anything to use." = "报文来自 VATSIM 的 METAR 服务，这是追踪器一直使用的同一来源，每个站点每小时发布一次。对于不发布报文的机场（也就是世界上大多数机场），读数来自 Open-Meteo 模型，并会注明；同一请求还会带回预报和展望，日月时间则在设备上计算。恶劣天气预警来自美国国家气象局（National Weather Service），仅覆盖美国。雷达瓦片来自 RainViewer；卫星图像来自 NASA 地球科学数据与信息系统中的 Global Imagery Browse Services；高空风同样来自 Open-Meteo。以上全部免费。";
"Runs through the two hours of frames behind the newest one. Off, the map draws the newest frame and nothing else, which is a seventh of the tiles and what the free tier is comfortable serving. The strip over the map says which frame is drawn either way, and can be dragged." = "播放最新一帧之前两小时的画面。关闭时地图只绘制最新一帧，瓦片量仅为七分之一，也是免费档能轻松提供的量。无论哪种情况，地图上方的时间条都会显示当前绘制的帧，并可拖动。";
